00:29:41.580 --> 00:29:49.609
jochem-brouwer: Which, says that if you create an account, so if you create a contract account, then you start with an empty tree.

247
00:29:49.810 --> 00:30:00.450
jochem-brouwer: And without Block Access Lists, this is fine, because we can just assume that… well, not assume, we just clear the tree, and we assume it is empty, and we can all, all is fine.

